Package: DesertLocustR
Type: Package
Title: Perform Pathway Enrichment In Schistocerca Species
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Devon", "Boland",
      email = "devonjboland@tamu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: DesertLocustR takes annotations files from the Eggnog mapper
    and GFF feature files to generate mapped gene names to annotation
    terms in the GO and KEGG databases. Specifically curated for species
    investigated by the Behavioral Plasticity Research Institute 'BPRI'.
Depends: GO.db, AnnotationHub, rtracklayer, Biostrings, data.table,
        dplyr, clusterProfiler, remotes
